{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VzZx4fMLRT1794813642.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近期市場氣氛正面，馬鞍山星漣海本月暫錄1宗成交，單位為2A座中層A室，實用面積1,660平方呎，4房連雙套房及工人套房間隔，開價約3000萬元，議價後連車位以2,620萬元易手，實用平均呎價15,783元。<br/>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為換樓客，見單位間隔合用，少有放盤，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2018年以3,051萬元購入單位，持貨約8年，是次轉手賬面上蝕431萬元或14.1%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:03:57.268182+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:41.260798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:57:16.228121+00:00","content_hash":"d85e5f3240dddcba819c13c1aa8c05a2a79c3d1994603ff4723c1f0d8c949c47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:03:57.268182+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}